[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 10861.429, "timestamp": "03:01:01", "text": "生活。被遗弃，被背叛，任其腐烂"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10867.19, "timestamp": "03:01:07", "text": "然后死去。靠自己。是的。但"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10871.19, "timestamp": "03:01:11", "text": "我们没事。我想我也加入你们。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10875.11, "timestamp": "03:01:15", "text": "让我来享用你手里的美味吧。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10878.309, "timestamp": "03:01:18", "text": "你记得遵循 v"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10882.15, "timestamp": "03:01:22", "text": "指导原则？等待。好的。现在我得到了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10885.59, "timestamp": "03:01:25", "text": "它。耶。你记得遵循……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10888.63, "timestamp": "03:01:28", "text": "指导原则？乔。保留所有物品。保持"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10891.349, "timestamp": "03:01:31", "text": "一切。你的笑话。再见。你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10893.429, "timestamp": "03:01:33", "text": "弄明白游戏规则。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10898.67, "timestamp": "03:01:38", "text": "是的。为什么？为什么我的麦克风是开着的？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10902.15, "timestamp": "03:01:42", "text": "好的。没有响应。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10906.07, "timestamp": "03:01:46", "text": "真的，一点儿也不假。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10908.469, "timestamp": "03:01:48", "text": "我喜欢我天生就是红头发。感谢"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10912.63, "timestamp": "03:01:52", "text": "你。谢谢。当下的神明。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10914.15, "timestamp": "03:01:54", "text": "哦，你将扮演《领主》"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10917.51, "timestamp": "03:01:57", "text": "喜剧演员莫莉。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10919.67, "timestamp": "03:01:59", "text": "你，你，你可以看到主在"}]